WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.010
The oldest light.

00:01.663 --> 00:06.828
The sphere is the edge of what can be seen at all, about 46 billion light-years away now.

00:07.284 --> 00:13.200
No light has travelled for longer than 13.8 billion years: space stretched while it came.

00:13.700 --> 00:21.530
The microwave background, released about 370 000 years after the Big Bang, reaches us from just inside it.

00:22.009 --> 00:24.451
It is a horizon around us, not a wall.

00:25.052 --> 00:26.535
Every place has its own.
